            "notes": "The radius increase from [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49) gives you a *lot* of leniency to be able to hit your whip shot consistently, which is pretty integral to our build here. With the added inspire uptime this is even better. \n\nIn some scenarios though, where you're facing a team that likes to stand behind their Rein/Sigma/Winston shield, making whip shot difficult to hit consistently, you might want to consider taking [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) first, as though the ability is a little finicky it *can* go through barriers.\n\nHOWEVER, if they *also* have flyers, you might want to take [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49) anyways. See round 3 notes under \"powers\" for why.",
