            "notes": "[Chain Extender](item_0a0d50dc-0ec9-42f6-a0ad-c373eb44dc6d) is great, it lets us play safe from far back and still keep inspire up pretty consistently. \n\nThough, if you didn't take [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49) round 1, then just minmax for the highest AP possible this round.\n\n### To Note: \nIf something is marked IMPORTANT, don't replace it with the optional items unless I say something about doing so in the round notes. Otherwise, swapping between the recommended and optional items each round is fair game.",
