            "notes": "### Powers\nSince the goal of this build is to get Rally as quickly as you can, usually I'd recommend getting [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) and [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49) as your first two powers, as this really helps to synergize with [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) later on. \n\nHowever, if flying heroes are becoming a problem, like [Pharah](hero_0baf7420-ff13-4b92-81f7-ca21b61dacf9), [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da) or [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424), or long-range heroes like [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54), then [God Ray](item_4abb5cdb-f113-4f21-aa0a-e67d95a11fd0) mixed with [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49) and [Chain Extender](item_0a0d50dc-0ec9-42f6-a0ad-c373eb44dc6d) can make you damage them whenever you have whip shot, and the DoT lasts for a few seconds, making them less likely to be a problem for a bit, or at least easier to kill for the rest of your team. Also, you can add in items like [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) or [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) to your build to *really* annoy them. \n\n### Items\nFairly simple path in the way of items this round. Decent AP and some limited CDR for better pack + inspire uptime. \n\n### TO NOTE:\nIn case you aren't aware, [Kiriko](hero_70a0ac5c-2a55-4fab-beeb-2f570886426f)'s Suzu cleanses negative effects like burning, or speed/healing debuffs like from [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98)/[Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505). Normally, this might just make her use her ability, which is good, but if she has [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68), this can just give her ult faster, especially when paired with CDR and [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b). \nThere are other cleanses in the game, like [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0) bubbles or [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed)'s [Voidhoppers](item_d4ce0c76-2500-40d6-b066-dca303be097f) power, but none (to my knowledge) that give the user a benefit such as Cleansing Charge does. Something to keep in mind if you get [God Ray](item_4abb5cdb-f113-4f21-aa0a-e67d95a11fd0).",
